<title>USA: Cato says president of division resigns.</title>
<headline>Cato says president of division resigns.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cato Corp said Thursday that Linda McFarland Jenkins resigned her position as president and chief merchandising officer of the Cato Division and director of the corporation to pursue other interests.  </p>
<p>The company said it is initiating a search for a new chief merchandising officer for the Cato Division.</p>
<p>Cato Corp vice chairman and chief operating officer John Derham Cato will assume the chief merchandising officer duties in the interim, the company said.</p>
